From 91f76701c4e74ebaf24c0f665140d1a5647fe40e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Guy Lyons <guylyons2@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 9 Sep 2026 22:07:27 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 6/7] macos-arm64: static props in the ray-traced geometry

Enumerate the map's static props through IStaticPropMgrClient, pull each
model's LOD0 triangles once via IStudioRender::GetTriangles, transform per
instance and append to the world mesh before the BVH build. Translucent and
alpha-tested materials are left out (no texture lookup in the tracer yet).
rt_static_props toggles it at map load; rt_list_props lists props with
origins and triangle counts.
---
 game/client/rt_layer.cpp | 162 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 1 file changed, 161 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/game/client/rt_layer.cpp b/game/client/rt_layer.cpp
index bd8d3ec..8765db5 100644
--- a/game/client/rt_layer.cpp
